tools_server_api: section {
  | The tests that prove the requirements of the spec's [server API](#heron.tools.server_api), of what
  | [the server](#heron.tools.server) does with it, of the [API reference](#heron.tools.frontend.screens.api_page),
  | [AsyncAPI](#heron.tools.asyncapi) and the [TextMate grammar](#heron.tools.tree_sitter.textmate).

  proves(heron.tools.server.serving.json_wire) {
    verify("internal/tools/server/files_test.go", test = "TestNoOp")
    verify("internal/tools/server/files_test.go", test = "TestConditionalWrite")
  }

